 Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2b83f449.py:16:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2b83f449.py:21:    Key insight: Tokens select drop columns by entry side and land at wall-bounded endpoints, ignoring blocker-bounded ones.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2b83f449.py:22:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2b83f449.py:98:        \"\"\"Return the single exit column, or None. Assert if >1 exit.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2b83f449.py:107:        \"\"\"Return the single entry column from the wall above, or None. Assert if >1.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2b83f449.py:479:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:16:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:17:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:20:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:25:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:31:    Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:34:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/fc4aaf52.py:168:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/f0f8a26d.py:29:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/f0f8a26d.py:30:    \"\"\"Rotate every foreground bar 90 degrees around its own center on the same canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/f0f8a26d.py:44:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/f0f8a26d.py:102:    \"\"\"Return input pixels for one placed bar, mutating occupied on success.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/f0f8a26d.py:150:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/9385bd28.py:9:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/9385bd28.py:13:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/9385bd28.py:39:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/9385bd28.py: